            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Manufacturer.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 2,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "I think this is lacking details. Which object/service is supposed to be implementing this? Are associations expected? How to associate with Version? Is it per Version/Device?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Manufacturer.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 2,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "1) smbios-mdr will be implementing this interface \nDiscussion for raising this MR is https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/79207?tab=comments\n2) Associations are not expected as SMBIOS would send firmware inventory record information with version, build date and manufacturer information.\n3) This will be part of SoftwareInventory schema. This is per Firmware"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Manufacturer.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "I wonder if we should reuse Inventory.Decorator.Asset? This is for SW inventory, right? Do you see issues in doing so?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Manufacturer.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "I had used Asset Interface but when MR was raised got suggestions to manufacturer and build date information under Software namespace https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/79207?tab=comments"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Manufacturer.interface.yaml",
